+   $$ \text{ijk}_{h,w,i} = s \cdot (P_{ijk,h,w} + \vec{d}_{ijk,h,w} \cdot \text{depths}_i) - 1 $$
+   Resulting shape: $(H, W, \text{ray\_samples}, 3)$ [S1, unofficial].
